  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">European Comiission DG Development finansierar ett seminiarium om h&#xe5;llbar energi den 25-27 juni i Santo Domingo, Dominikanska  Republiken. Sida finansierar deltagandet av tre talare fr&#xe5;n ACP Islands till en kostnad av 100 000 SEK. Pengarna ska t&#xe4;cka kostnader f&#xf6;r flygbiljetter tur och retur, ers&#xe4;ttning samt uppeh&#xe4;lle.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">European Comission DG Development is finansing a seminar on  Sustainable Energy on the 25-27th of June in Santo Domingo, Dominican Republic. Sida is contributing by supporting the attendance of 3 speakers from ACP Island states with 100 000 SEK. The amount will be used for the flights and per-diem payments.</narrative>
